  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "林正芳招你來宜蘭食平安糜 ——是文史工作者mā是煮糜gâu人"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／林大米</b><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（Podcast「米米之音」主持人）</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">、</span><b style=\"font-size: large;\">林正芳</b><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（「阿芳鹹粥」頭家）</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>記錄／戴如意</b></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣人愛食糜，tī宜蘭，甚至有「平安糜」ê文化——過年時tsūn，寺廟煮鹹糜，免費hōo來行春ê信徒食，祈求平安健康。因為吸引真濟外地人，宜蘭縣政府koh出一份平安糜地圖，記錄每一个寺廟佗一工有煮糜、糜是tsho--ê iah是素--ê，今年有將近兩百間寺廟參與tsit个盛會。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">平安糜是鹹--ê，料真phong-phài，有香菇、高麗菜、紅菜頭、白菜頭、豆皮、芹菜；有一句話講：「靠山食山，靠海食海」，受地理位置影響、逐位囥ê料mā ē無啥仝，親像南方澳ē加海產，圓山大山跤ē配sīnn--過ê菜頭葉。有ê廟koh ē另外tshuân圓仔湯，hōo民眾食甜甜。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">林正芳是食平安糜ê專家，伊分享伊行春ê慣勢：ē kā真濟份糖仔餅tshuân好，行一間廟就拜一份，燒金中間就歇睏食糜。行春ê順序ē tuì故鄉壯圍ê庄頭開始，koh來是in阿公khah早做塗水ê頭城，suà--落就無一定，一工上ke ē走五、六間廟。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">除了食糜，林正芳mā煮糜，伊開一間號做「阿芳鹹粥」ê店，beh推廣米食文化。人講：「作田食五頓」，khah早ê作穡人，三頓正頓掠外，koh ài食兩頓點心。In阿母ē煮菜頭糜、米篩目，方便、簡單koh好食。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">因為對米食ê愛，就算家族lóng離開宜蘭--ah，林正芳iáu是決心beh tńg來故鄉開店。伊笑講，是讀冊讀siunn濟ê緣故。伊堅持用真材實料面對消費者，雖然khah歹趁，m̄-koh伊相信，做久就ē變好；偷工減料成本無khah省，而且生理bē久長。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">米ê種類ē影響糜ê口感，lán tsit-má食著糊糊、煮kah無米心ê ám糜仔，是用蓬萊米煮--ê；若beh食湯清清ê hit款，就ài用在來米。林正芳上尾mā教一个撇步，若對煮食無熟，ē-sái先用電鍋炊--過，熟飯提來煮糜khah bē失敗；煮了ài小可降溫、hōo米吸水，tsiah ē食著軟軟、khó-khó koh好食ê糜。</span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: small; text-align: justify;\">「米米之音」是一个農村廣播節目，自2015年開播。主持人林大米當初辭頭路、搬到宜蘭，決定家己製作網路廣播，beh做「農民生活聲音紀錄者」。大米行踏全台灣，分享農業議題，記錄作穡人ê生活kap種作理念；ǹg望透過節目，走揣農村hām農業ê價值。Uì tsit期開始，雜誌精選部份節目做記錄，設「農民食堂」專欄刊出。Tsit篇是2021/2/21節目ê文字記錄。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: small; text-align: justify;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: small; text-align: justify;\"><b>mimivoice 米米之音&nbsp;</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: small; text-align: justify;\"><b>20210221&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>林正芳</b></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: small; text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/meilin/20210221-radio\" target=\"_blank\"><b>https://soundcloud.com/meilin/20210221-radio</b></a></span></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div><br /></div><div><div><span><b>#</b></span><b>農民食堂&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</span></b></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報330期，2021年9月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgm0v6V5R64wBUCdMf19Ro0TejpCs_ZgYKkZTG8Cp6SLDU86-i8R1nLazdPPCzNGy591n9hzdCjaGynLNibVcNzNNGD6mDO27vNj0D9k696x_AikzDxDddPQj5TxOmBSWxz-u9xuxaQBNQNLVHzNV_FmQCRLm3wv_6U38L83fLLLzVpykoTOVv4Ocd48Q=s1424\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgm0v6V5R64wBUCdMf19Ro0TejpCs_ZgYKkZTG8Cp6SLDU86-i8R1nLazdPPCzNGy591n9hzdCjaGynLNibVcNzNNGD6mDO27vNj0D9k696x_AikzDxDddPQj5TxOmBSWxz-u9xuxaQBNQNLVHzNV_FmQCRLm3wv_6U38L83fLLLzVpykoTOVv4Ocd48Q=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiA5BJD845CnKLDp8QqzZ-MrEiUpQqaxLri-E3D_woXrp8eh6vkxYOvIXwxUyVa9al-jSSocdC6B6Xg5Y7jx0grLEQHgk1hp5m6GoCO0jmTItB0QrriGT07qK5QBrbaCB5EfA6kygK0z16b4DhW8TPw4GefVLrnuouBvT_ME149k9fqdCk33D5dxZG9Wg=s2048\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2048\" data-original-width=\"1450\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiA5BJD845CnKLDp8QqzZ-MrEiUpQqaxLri-E3D_woXrp8eh6vkxYOvIXwxUyVa9al-jSSocdC6B6Xg5Y7jx0grLEQHgk1hp5m6GoCO0jmTItB0QrriGT07qK5QBrbaCB5EfA6kygK0z16b4DhW8TPw4GefVLrnuouBvT_ME149k9fqdCk33D5dxZG9Wg=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><b><br /></b></span></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">--------------------------------------------</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div></div></div></div>"
